{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 15, :comments ["<b>לבני ישראל.</b> It is not attached to the first verse, for in the first verse it says that these cities shall be cities of refuge, but it did not say refuge for whom. Afterward it clarified: for the children of Israel and for the stranger who sojourns among them — these six cities shall be for refuge."], :book :numbers, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 35, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:20:18.879233655Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}